  "outstanding": [
    "The distant occurrence is constructed in IBO-01–04 with the invariant Casimir cut in CCF-01–03, the compact weight estimates in CWC-01–03 and the terminal unitary identification in TBT-01–03. STO-01–02 give the derivative-layer comparison used for coefficient rigidity. The mixed tensor position bounds, analytic invariance and large-gap model construction have further inputs. The smaller-parameter transport is reconstructed in SML-01–03. The normalized test at an existing occurrence and the quantitative estimate at the final target serve different purposes."
  ]
